# Input graph for StarlightGraph.update (a SPARQL UPDATE run on a raw view of
# the graph's store). Two sensors, a node of another class, and a status
# that the DELETE updates of the driver target; the neighbours (ex:o1, the
# status of ex:o1) must stay untouched by updates that name sensors only.
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:s1 a ex:Sensor ; ex:status "ok" .
ex:s2 a ex:Sensor ; ex:status "ok" .
ex:o1 a ex:Other ; ex:status "ok" .
